    "detailed_description": "Too boring? What to play, if you do not want anything? Launch the pig called Hohol!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach of us wondered what to play, if you do not want anything. And the answer is found!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart the pig in the sky and do not let it fall as far as possible. Get money for this and run the pig even further.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt your disposal 1 flying bacon and 6 types of improvements for her flight!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- You found a way out of the hopeless situation;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Establish personal records in the field of flight bacon;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- You earn money with a flying bacon;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 6 types of updates to run;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Not everyone loves pigs, anger them with this game in their profile;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;It's a pink flying pig, what else could it be?&quot;",
